      "mergedPostDetails": "Using Udon it's possible to set the minimum height to a value above 5, and the maximum height below 0.2. What I was expecting was that it would limit the values I try to set for the minimum and maximum height to 0.2 and 5, not just their corresponding upper and lower bounds.",
